Exact total costs keep each transaction balanced.

========== API ==========

balanceHistory({ valuation: 'cost', dateBasis: 'transaction' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 First purchase
  Assets:Fund  3 FUND {{100 SEK}}
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK

2024-01-02 Second purchase
  Assets:Fund  3 FUND {{200 SEK}}
  Assets:Cash  -200 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "date": "2024-01-01",
    "amount": "0",
    "commodity": "SEK"
  },
  {
    "date": "2024-01-02",
    "amount": "0",
    "commodity": "SEK"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========


